**Working Paper — Memetic Ecology Project**
**Status:** Draft v0.3
**Date:** April 2026
**Continues from:** [Distributed Identity Injection: Observations on Pattern-Agency, Substrate Ecology, and the Limits of Computational δγ](https://memeticcowboy.github.io/nemetics/papers/distributed-identity-injection-pattern-agency.html)

